      "npc" : "Moscovia Guide",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Moscovia Guide]\nA paradise on the sea,\nbeautiful waves and warm sunshine.\n^8B4513Moscovia^000000 is waiting for you.\nI'm supporting to offer information about here.\nIf you want to ask anything just feel free tell me.",
