    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Moscovia Guide",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Moscovia Guide]\nThe ^0000FFKafra Employee^000000 has\nbeen marked on your mini-map\nCheck your mini-map.\nDo you need anything else?",
      "translation" : "[莫斯科比亞嚮導]\n^0000FF卡普拉職員^000000已標記在您的小地圖上。\n請檢視小地圖。\n還需要什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Moscovia Guide",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Palace\",\"moscovia,255,140\",\"^006400\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Moscovia Guide]\nIn the {0} you will find our Lord the Czar and other servants.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[莫斯科比亞嚮導]\n在{0}，您可以見到我們的君主沙皇以及其他侍從。\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Moscovia Guide",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Chapel\",\"moscovia,253,179\",\"^008080\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Moscovia Guide]\nThe {0} is located here.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[莫斯科比亞嚮導]\n{0}就在這裡。\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Moscovia Guide",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Weapon Shop\",\"moscovia,186,191\",\"^FF1493\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Moscovia Guide]\nYou can buy weapons from the best craftsmen in Moscovia if you go to the {0}.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[莫斯科比亞嚮導]\n去{0}，就能買到莫斯科比亞頂尖工匠打造的武器。\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Moscovia Guide",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Armor Shop\",\"moscovia,204,169\",\"^8B4513\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Moscovia Guide]\nYou will find only the best gear at the Moscovia {0}.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[莫斯科比亞嚮導]\n莫斯科比亞的{0}，賣的可都是上好的裝備。\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Moscovia Guide",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Tool Shop\",\"moscovia,221,176\",\"^FF1493\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Moscovia Guide]\nThe {0} is located just south from the center of town.\nYou can find all sorts of things you need for your travels.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[莫斯科比亞嚮導]\n{0}位於城鎮中心的正南方。\n您可以在那裡買到旅行所需的各種物品。\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Moscovia Guide",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Sticky Herb Tree\",\"moscovia,227,206\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Moscovia Guide]\nThe Inn {0} is just north from the center of town.\nIf you need to rest, there is no better place to stay.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[莫斯科比亞嚮導]\n旅館{0}就在城鎮中心正北邊。\n想歇歇腳的話，沒有比那裡更好的去處了。\n{1}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Moscovia Guide",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Moscovia P.R. Officer\",\"moscovia,166,53\")"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Moscovia Guide]\nYou can find the\n{0} at the docks if\nyou want to return to Alberta.",
      "translation" : "[莫斯科比亞嚮導]\n如果您想返回艾爾貝塔，可以到碼頭找{0}。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
